@startuml Vista de Processos – Level 2 (US 2.2.8 – Submit Vessel Visit Notification)
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor Black
    ActorBorderColor #000000
    ActorBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    LifeLineBorderColor Black
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    ParticipantBorderColor Black
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    ParticipantFontStyle bold
}

actor "Shipping Agent Representative" as Agent
participant "<<container (C4)>>\nVisualization (UI)" as UI #87CEEB
participant "<<container (C4)>>\nVisits & Manifests" as VVM #87CEEB

activate Agent
Agent -> UI: 1: asks to submit a VVN
activate UI
UI --> Agent: 1.1: shows active VVN and asks to select one
deactivate UI
Agent -> UI: 2: selects VVN and requests submission
activate UI
UI -> VVM: 2.1: submit selected VVN (vvnId)
activate VVM
VVM --> UI: 2.1.1: marked as "submitted" and Port Authority Officer notified
UI --> Agent: 2.2: submission confirmation
deactivate VVM
deactivate UI
deactivate Agent

@enduml